'''The Burgle Cats''' ('''にゃんこ大泥棒''', ''lit.'' '''Nyanko Great Burglar''') was a spin-off game of [[The Battle Cats]]/[[Nyanko Daisensou]] that was developed by [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]]. The Japanese version was released on October 14th, 2019, while the international version was released on February 23rd, 2021. It was shut down on December 22nd, 2025.

