==Known Bugs==
*There was an unknown way to trigger escape smoke cancel under slow debuff, each cancel returned 10% maximum willpower back.
*At random points, the screen would freeze and flash between black and the background menu the player is currently on.
*At random points, the game would crash upon selecting any button.
*Sometimes when entering the cat hunter all buttons would become unclickable, eventually forcing the player to close and reopen the game.
*For some devices, a part of the right side of the screen did not function.
*During co-op games, if one player stole the treasure and got a game over for running out of willpower while transitioning from an exit door to the outside, it would be impossible for the other player to collect the treasure, even if they entered through the same door.

==Trivia==
*Originally when the game first released in Japan, it had English dialogue included. However, this was fixed in future updates.

